# vhs script — hero recording of the three-act demo (16:9)
# Reproduce: run from a dir where @antlegion/bus is npm-installed:
#   cd <recdir> && vhs <repo>/site/media/demo-hero.tape
Output demo-hero.mp4
Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1200
Set Height 675
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Type "npx @antlegion/bus demo"
Enter
Sleep 17s
